{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmmxbsQBsUGDLwjokWEq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I looked at all five screenshots. The fifth one is just a black strip, so the page ends after option B.\n\n## 1. My answer\n\n**I'd join the keren hishtalmut. I'm about 90% sure.** The sentence that decided it for me was **\"כל שקל שהפקדתם נהיה 3.70 ₪ בקרן ו-1.09 ₪ בחשבון ניירות ערך\"**. After 5 years I'd have **\"66,513 ₪\"** against **\"19,595 ₪\"**. When the strip moves to year 6, **\"מס במשיכה 0 ₪\"** shows up and the total grows to **\"98,738 ₪\"**. The other 10% is because I don't know what happens if I quit or need the money before year 6.\n\n**Option B (\"ב. כל חלק בעמודה משלו\") is the one I'd rather see**, even though A has the **\"מומלץ\"** badge. In B the chart reads left to right like a story: my money, then what the employer adds, then profit, then the tax goes *down*, then what's left. In A, the tax (**\"−13,974 ₪\"**) sits on *top* of the column as a striped block. That made me think it was money I get, until I saw the minus sign. B's tax bar drops below the line before, so I understood it right away.\n\n## 2. What I actually used\n- The sentence about each shekel becoming 3.70 / 1.09 (the same in both options)\n- The two big totals, **\"נשאר בידיים\"**\n- The year strip with the dashed line: **\"לפני 6 שנים: מס\"** / **\"מ-6 שנים: פטור ממס\"**\n- The repeated year-6 chart in option A (**\"אותו ציור שנה אחת אחר כך\"**)\n- The B waterfall\n- The labels **\"300 ₪ בחודש מכם, 900 ₪ מהמעסיק\"**\n\n## 3. Block by block\n- **Title \"קרן השתלמות: בלי כדורים ובלי טבלה\" and subtitle:** Skimmed. \"Without balls and without a table\" means nothing to me. I guess it refers to an older version I never saw.\n- **\"מה היה:\" small old picture with dots and a table:** Skipped. It's tiny, and the text says it's the version that was replaced.\n- **Orange/grey example paragraph (\"הדוגמה: שכר ברוטו 12,000 ₪...\")**: Partly used, partly confused. **\"⚠ הנחה: אתם 2.5% והמעסיק 7.5%\"** helped, and so did **\"האחוזים האמיתיים כתובים בהסכם העבודה\"**, because it tells me where to check. The rest lost me: **\"מיטב השתלמות\"**, **\"(13245)\"**, **\"פייר פיננשיאל טכנולוג'יז\"**, **\"(4D)\"**, **\"דמי ניהול 0.54%\"**. **\"עצמאים: 500 ₪\"** doesn't apply to me, so I skipped it.\n- **\"א. עמודה לכל דרך\" + \"שכירים / עצמאים\" toggle:** Used. The toggle was already on שכירים, which was fine. The line **\"החיסרון: החלק של הרווח והחלק של המס יושבים זה על זה\"** was honest, and it's exactly what confused me.\n- **A, year 5 chart:** Used the totals and the yellow block. The labels sit on the side with thin lines pointing at small striped slices, so it took effort to match them.\n- **A, year 6 repeat:** Very useful. Watching the tax disappear between year 5 and year 6 is what told me \"don't touch it before 6\".\n- **Small grey footnote (\"בקרן, בין 19 המסלולים... 66,280 ₪... עד 67,028 ₪... בחשבון... 10,764 ₪\")**: Skimmed. I took away that the keren result barely changes whichever one you pick, while the other account can come out much worse (10,764). I didn't understand \"מסלולים\" or \"תעריפים\".\n- **\"העמודות נמתחות לגובה הציור...\" note:** Skipped. It's a note about the drawing, not about my money.\n- **\"ב. כל חלק בעמודה משלו\" + waterfall:** Used. It was the clearest part of the page. The intro text says B only shows the last column, but as far as I could see it shows the same year-5 strip as A.\n\n## 4. Colours, labels, lines\n- **Looked at:**\n  - grey = **\"ההפקדות שלכם\"**\n  - yellow = **\"הפקדות המעסיק\"**\n  - teal = **\"רווח אחרי דמי ניהול\"**\n  - pink striped = **\"מס במשיכה\"**\n  - white = **\"נשאר בידיים\"**\n  - the dashed line at year 6, with its pink label \"מס\" on the left and white label \"פטור ממס\" on the right\n  - the circled year number\n- **Ignored:** the dotted purple underlines under the numbers (are they links? I couldn't tell), the year 7–12 bars beyond noticing that they keep growing, and the small print under the old preview.\n\n## 5. What I didn't understand\n- **\"דמי ניהול\"**: I guess it's a fee, but how much does it actually take?\n- **\"מסלול\"** and **\"תעריף\"**\n- **\"עד תקרה בחוק\"**: what is the limit?\n- Why the tax at year 5 is so big (**−13,974** in the keren against **−594** in the other account)\n- What a **\"חשבון ניירות ערך\"** really is, compared with \"just buying the S&P 500\"\n\n## 6. What I wanted and couldn't find\n- **What happens if I leave this job before 6 years?** Do I lose the employer's part? Does the clock restart?\n- Can I take the money out before 6 years at all, or only with that tax?\n- Does the 300 ₪ come off my take-home pay, so my monthly net goes down?\n- If I don't join, does the employer give me the 900 ₪ some other way, or is it just lost?\n- How I actually join, and who I talk to\n\n## 7. If half the page had to go\nIn this order:\n1. The **\"מה היה\"** old preview\n2. The **\"העמודות נמתחות...\"** notes\n3. The fund and code names in the example paragraph. I'd keep the 2.5%/7.5% warning.\n4. Option A's year-5 stacked chart\n\nI'd keep the 3.70 sentence, the year strip with the 6-year line, the B waterfall, and a year-6 view like the one A has."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7430,"cache_read_input_tokens":3707,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7430},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"db59b299-72f5-4a61-8812-8f52a70e676a","uuid":"945e5b2e-3d67-4e2c-9477-f90868ad2f76","timestamp":"2026-11-06T13:46:13.538Z","request_id":"req_011CgmmxbY4TYrUDeuBfJ5vJ"}
